bball:HallOfFameBallot a svs:ClassShape ;
	rdfs:label "Hall of Fame Ballot"@en ;
	rdfs:comment "One appearance on one Hall of Fame ballot. A candidate appears on many across their eligibility, and in a single year can appear on more than one electorate's ballot — 146 rows of the register do — so the voting body is part of this resource's identity alongside the candidate and the year. The voting body's name has spaces in it on 1,205 rows, so the subject IRI splices a slugged form of it and bball:votingBody delivers the raw label; the mapping document carries the argument for slugging rather than encoding."@en .
_:c14n31 sh:path bball:player ;
	sh:class bball:Person ;
	sh:maxCount 1 ;
	sh:description "The candidate."@en .
